Open Video Source

  </a></section><section class="card">  <h2>Download History</h2>  <p class="description">
    Your recent successful downloads are stored
    on this device.
  </p>  <div id="historyList"></div><button
class="clear-button"
id="clearHistoryButton"
type="button"

